---
// src/pages/en/privacy.astro
// Global Privacy Policy & Children's Privacy Notice (GDPR, LOPDGDD, FERPA, COPPA)
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="alternate icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Global Privacy Policy & Children's Privacy Notice (COPPA / FERPA / GDPR) | ColabEdu.net</title>
    <meta name="description" content="ColabEdu Global Privacy Policy & COPPA Notice: Anonymous Classroom Mode (Zero-PII Roster), ZeroPiiLlmGateway, ephemeralZeroRetention, and Zero AI Foundation Model Training.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style is:global>
        :root {
            --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background-color: #FAF9F6;
            color: #0F172A;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .precision-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <Header lang="en" currentPath="/en/privacy" />

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-10">
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 text-teal-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                    COLABEDU-LEGAL-PRIVACY-COPPA-EN-v2.0 · Effective Nov 19, 2026
                </span>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-Privacy-Policy-and-COPPA-Notice-EN.pdf" download class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-teal-700 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-teal-800 transition">
                    Download Official PDF &darr;
                </a>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">
                Global Privacy Policy &amp; Children's Privacy Notice (GDPR, FERPA &amp; COPPA)
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Applicable across ColabEdu web portals (<code>colabedu.org</code> / <code>colabedu.net</code>), the interactive A2UI application (<code>app.colabedu.net</code>), the LTI 1.3 Advantage connector, and the browser extension (<code>ColabEdu LMS &amp; SpeedGrader Assistant</code>).
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="precision-card p-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. Our Immutable Pledge: The Classroom Is Not a Commercial Product</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Zero Targeted Advertising &amp; Zero Commercial Profiling:</strong> We never display advertisements, retargeting pixels, or behavioral trackers in any lesson, app, or browser extension.</li>
                <li><strong>Zero AI Foundation Model Training on Student Data:</strong> Student essays, voice recordings, handwritten scans, and assessment grades are never used to train, retrain, or fine-tune foundational or public AI models.</li>
                <li><strong>Zero Sale of Personal Information:</strong> We never sell, rent, or trade personal data or student education records to third parties, data brokers, or marketers.</li>
                <li><strong>Strict Regional Data Sovereignty (US vs. EU):</strong> United States and Americas school district data resides exclusively in US data centers (<code>us-central1</code> Iowa / <code>us-east-1</code> Virginia). European Union school data resides exclusively in EU data centers (<code>europe-west3</code> / <code>eu-central-1</code> Frankfurt).</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">2. Legal Roles: Data Processor ("School Official") vs. Controller</h2>
            <p>
                <strong>Institutional / School Deployment:</strong> When a school, school district, university, or teacher deploys ColabEdu with students (via LTI 1.3 Advantage, school SSO, or the Chrome Extension on Canvas, Moodle, or Google Classroom), the <strong>Educational Institution is the Data Controller</strong> (under GDPR Art. 28) and educational agency under <strong>FERPA (34 CFR § 99.31(a)(1)(i)(B))</strong>, while ColabEdu acts strictly as a Data Processor / School Official governed by our <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-US-SDPC-FERPA-Exhibit.pdf" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">US SDPC/FERPA Addendum</a> or <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-DPA-GDPR-EN.pdf" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">EU GDPR Art. 28 DPA</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Direct Individual / Family Accounts:</strong> When an independent educator, adult learner, or parent/legal guardian registers a personal or family self-study account (<em>Safe Space Private</em>), Healthcentrix Inc. DBA ColabEdu US (in the US/Americas) or ColabEdu S.L. (in the EU) acts as the Data Controller for that account.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">3. Privacy Modes, ZeroPiiLlmGateway, and Ephemeral Zero Retention</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-900">Anonymous Classroom Mode (Zero-PII Roster)</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                        In the Chrome Extension, <code>shared/pii_anonymizer.js</code> maps real student names to deterministic opaque aliases (<code>stu_001</code>, <code>stu_002</code>) locally inside <code>chrome.storage.local</code> on the teacher's device. <strong>0% of student PII ever leaves the teacher's browser.</strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-900">ZeroPiiLlmGateway &amp; ephemeralZeroRetention</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                        Prior to any AI inference call, the backend scrubs names, emails, SSNs/IDs, and EXIF/PDF metadata, renames files to <code>&lt;sha256&gt;.pdf</code>, and when <code>ephemeralZeroRetention: true</code> is enabled, permanently deletes uploaded media inside a <code>finally</code> block (<code>DELETE</code>) immediately after scoring.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">4. Children's Privacy Notice (COPPA, GDPR Article 8 &amp; LOPDGDD Article 7)</h2>
            <p>
                When a school or district uses ColabEdu with students under 13 years of age (under COPPA, 16 CFR Part 312) or minor students in the EEA/UK (under GDPR Art. 8), the school or district authorizes the processing strictly for educational purposes. For home self-study accounts involving minors, the account must be created and supervised by a parent or legal guardian. Parents or authorized school officials may review, export (<code>UserPassport.json</code>), or permanently purge (<code>./ce-cli.sh user purge</code>) all student records at any time.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">5. Data Subject Rights &amp; DPO Contact</h2>
            <p>
                To exercise your rights of Access, Rectification, Erasure ("Right to be Forgotten"), Restriction, Data Portability, or Objection, or to execute a district DPA, contact our Data Protection Office at <a href="mailto:privacy@colabedu.org" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">privacy@colabedu.org</a> or <a href="mailto:dpo@colabedu.net" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">dpo@colabedu.net</a>, or visit our <a href="/en/trust" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">Trust &amp; Compliance Center (/en/trust)</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <Footer lang="en" />
</body>
</html>
